<!--Gem_Page_Main_Editor--><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="gryffeditor"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1621898701107" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1621898701107"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621898701083" data-id="1621898701083"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1621898707379" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1621898707379"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>KAPOK KNOTが始めるあたらしい取り組み<br>「深井喜翔の○○タイム」。<br>今ブランドで起こっていること、そして<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">これからのチャレンジについて、</span></p><p>代表 深井喜翔自らが体験している生の声をお伝えする連載です。</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1621898634646" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1621898634646"><div class="gf_column gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1621898634744" data-id="1621898634744"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1621898642537" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1621898642537"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>【深井喜翔の○○タイム】</strong></h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>ニュースレターの3つのポイント</strong></h1></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1621898920238" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1621898920238"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621898920246" data-id="1621898920246"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1621901376159" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1621901376159" data-resolution="3000x3000" style="display: block;"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/4df3f11e-c138-4e1b-a992-68eefd3e19a5/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/knotaday_LP_thumnail_1.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1081" natural-height="704"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621898920285" data-id="1621898920285"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1621901430300" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901430300" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>あらゆる視点から考える</strong></h2><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>「カポックの可能性」</strong></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1621901473357" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901473357"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">私たちにとって、「カポック」という素材は切っても切り離せない大切な素材です。<span style="letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">この可能性を模索し、「世界中にサステナブルで機能的な素材を届ける」ことを目指した探求の話をお伝えしていきます。</span></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1621901594346" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1621901594346" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901594382" data-id="1621901594382"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1621901615148" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901615148"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>モノづくりやサステナブルに関する</strong></h2><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>情報を厳選して紹介</strong></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1621901624840" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901624840"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>モノづくりやサステナブルにまつわる情報を世界中のニュースから厳選してお届けします。季節に応じた取り組みや、イノベーションの種、応援したいプロジェクトなど、様々な内容を発信。日常的にまつわる情報から、深井喜翔の気になるトピックを共有いたします。</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901595807" data-id="1621901595807"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1621901602984" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1621901602984" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/20a253e1-8fe1-4ddf-829e-f3cd654623b4/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/knotaday_LP_thumnail_2.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1081" natural-height="704"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1624184318410" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1624184318410" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901594382" data-id="1621901594382"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1624184318470" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1624184318470" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/20a253e1-8fe1-4ddf-829e-f3cd654623b4/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/knotaday_LP_thumnail_2.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1081" natural-height="704"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901595807" data-id="1621901595807"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1624184318520" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1624184318520"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">サステナブルに関する情報を厳選して紹介</h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1624184318424" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1624184318424"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>サステナブルにまつわる情報を世界中のニュースから厳選してお届けします。季節に応じた取り組みや、イノベーションの種、応援したいプロジェクトなど、様々な内容を発信します。日常的にサステナブルにまつわる情報から、理解を深めていただけます。</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1621901657804" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1621901657804" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901657822" data-id="1621901657822"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1621901664725" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1621901664725" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/c9b72c8c-2e73-49d0-b956-f7b0d557a4d8/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/knotaday_LP_thumnail_3.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1081" natural-height="704"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1621901660003" data-id="1621901660003"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1621901678108" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901678108"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="text-align: inherit; background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: rgb(var(--text-color)); letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);"><strong>一緒に考える</strong></span></h2><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="text-align: inherit; background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: rgb(var(--text-color)); letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);"><strong>「今ファッションを楽しむことと</strong></span></h2><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="text-align: inherit; background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: rgb(var(--text-color)); letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);"><strong>未来について考えること」の現在地</strong></span></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1621901683913" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1621901683913"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>これまで、私は常々プレゼンテーションの最後に、<br><br></p><p>「今ファッションを楽しむことと<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">未来について考えること」</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; text-align: inherit;">その2つを繋ぐのがカポックノットなのです。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">ということを言い続けてきました。</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">その現在地を皆様のご意見もいただきながら、探求していければと思っています。</span></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1624180126703" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1624180126703" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1621898634744" data-id="1621898634744"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1624180126680" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1624180126680" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit; background-color: rgb(var(--background));"><strong>代表深井のスケジュール次第の時々配信</strong></span><br></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1624180159146" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1624180159146"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>この連載は、<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">あくまで深井喜翔個人が、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">無理のない範囲で書いていく連載になります。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">期間を定めることで、期限に迫られて、</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(var(--background)); color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; text-align: inherit;">あぁやらなきゃ。。。となるのっていやじゃないですか。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.3px; background-color: rgb(var(--background));">なので、今回は私の心と体の機嫌を聞きながらのスケジュール次第となります。</span></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1730285535563" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1730285535563"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1730285535543" data-id="1730285535543"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1730283896720" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1730283896720" data-layout-lg="12" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="12" data-layout-sm="12" data-layout-xs="12" style=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1730249910068" data-id="1730249910068"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1730285328216" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1730285328216" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong><u>最新の投稿はこちら</u></strong></p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-173028